ISCIENCE ON RETRO STUDIO - \n\nThe Valentine event is over!","path":"/game/8447279898-the-pointless-printer-game","slug":"8447279898-the-pointless-printer-game","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/02f9fe90ca71863824bb7ab791fdba011da97f59ca53e8fd7aa0b0a27f8fb708.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-373727c32e98fa61bd1edbe9a7b2a4eb/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":2,"visitor":15487287,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-03-09T22:45:10.826Z","creator":{"name":"The Basic Studs","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}}],"totalGames":14119,"totalPages":589,"currentPage":333}